  "_doc": "Pose-picture config for Arghya (tools/art/build_poses.py). Each sheet lists its 8 poses left to right. 'lines' are polylines (sheet pixels) drawn along the pose's body, limbs and hammer: where poses overlap on the sheet, each pixel goes to the pose whose lines are closest inside the silhouette. 'hip' is the x the fighter stands on (default: the 3rd point of the first line). 'air' poses are anchored at their lowest pixel instead of the sheet's ground line. 'scale' evens out the character's size between sheets.",
